# 🚀 PortFlio - Personal Portfolio & Pro AV / System Solutions

Welcome to the repository for my personal portfolio web application! This project showcases my professional experience in **Pro AV Systems, Broadcast Engineering, PTZ Camera Configurations, and Technical Solutions**, alongside my background in scientific research and ecological data analysis.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Tools

- **Frontend:** React.js, Vite, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+)
- **Styling & UI:** Modern UI/UX, Responsive Web Design
- **Domain Focus:** Pro AV Systems, Video Routing, Live Broadcast, Technical Specifications (TOR)

---

## ✨ Features

- **Professional Showcase:** Highlights specialized projects in Audio-Visual designs, PTZ camera networks, and smart conference room integrations.
- **Interactive Interface:** Clean, fast, and modern responsive design built with Vite for optimal performance.
- **Project Case Studies:** Detailed breakdown of technical solution architecture, field deployment, and workflow automation.

